<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="In 4.1 Main results ‣ 4 Experimental results ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">EBFT matches RLVR and outperforms SFT on downstream accuracy.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.1 Main results ‣ 4 Experimental results ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">EBFT achieves lower cross-entropy than SFT, while RLVR degrades it.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.1 Main results ‣ 4 Experimental results ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">EBFT achieves the lowest feature-matching loss.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.1 Main results ‣ 4 Experimental results ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The CE loss coefficient <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> improves CE loss without sacrificing downstream performance or feature matching.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px5" title="In 4.1 Main results ‣ 4 Experimental results ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">EBFT generalizes better than SFT to out-of-distribution benchmarks.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In 4 Experimental results ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2 </span>Ablations</span></a>
