</figure>
<div id="A7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Hyperparameter details for the SFT training runs are provided in Table <a href="#A7.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix G Additional Experimental Details ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> for the warmstarted models (initialization for EBFT/RLVR) and in Table <a href="#A7.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix G Additional Experimental Details ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> for the five-epoch SFT baseline runs. We sweep over learning rate scheduler as well as training batch size for each task.</p>
</div>
