<div id="A7.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Hyperparameters for RLVR training runs are provided in Table <a href="#A7.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix G Additional Experimental Details ‣ Matching Features, Not Tokens: Energy-Based Fine-Tuning of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>. For RLVR, we fix training to be online and determine rollout batch size by roughly equating number of examples seen per step across both RLVR and EBFT for each task, sweeping over two values.</p>
</div>
