<span id="A8.F19.pic1.p3.8" class="ltx_quote">
<span id="A8.F19.pic1.p3.8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F19.pic1.p3.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TIL that the Tigers will take revenge on those who have done wrong to them.
</span></span>
