<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:29.74em;">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">MTNT: Meaning flip via dropped negation (“no more” <math id="A8.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> “more”)<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(EN<math id="A8.F21.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>FR). Source:<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Then there are no more available rooms.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Ref:<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Il n’y a plus de chambres disponibles.</span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1B9E77;">EBFT</span><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> <span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(clean/on-task):</span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.3" class="ltx_quote">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Puis il n’y a plus d’espaces disponibles.
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#3D3D3D;">Base</span><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> <span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(failure; runaway):</span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.5" class="ltx_quote">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Il n’y a plus d’espaces disponibles.
<br class="ltx_break">Spanish: No hay mas habitaciones disponibles.
<br class="ltx_break">Italian: Non ci sono più stanze disponibili.
<br class="ltx_break">...
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(continuation omitted)<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.6.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#7570B3;">SFT</span><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> <span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.7.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(failure; weaker paraphrase):</span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.8" class="ltx_quote">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Puis il n’y a plus d’offres de chambres.
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D95F02;">RLVR</span><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.9.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> <span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.9.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(failure; meaning flip):</span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.10" class="ltx_quote">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Puis il y a plus de chambres.
<br class="ltx_break">Portugu^es: Portanto, existem mais quartos.
<br class="ltx_break">Portugu^es-Cogitado: Portanto, existem mais quartos.
<br class="ltx_break">...
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(continuation omitted)<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p3.11.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
