<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.F21.pic1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="35.85" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 434.07 35.85" width="434.07"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,35.85) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E11D48;" fill="#E11D48" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.21 L 0 33.64 C 0 34.86 0.99 35.85 2.21 35.85 L 431.86 35.85 C 433.08 35.85 434.07 34.86 434.07 33.64 L 434.07 2.21 C 434.07 0.99 433.08 0 431.86 0 L 2.21 0 C 0.99 0 0 0.99 0 2.21 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFF1F2;" fill="#FFF1F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.55 2.21 L 0.55 33.64 C 0.55 34.56 1.3 35.3 2.21 35.3 L 431.86 35.3 C 432.77 35.3 433.52 34.56 433.52 33.64 L 433.52 2.21 C 433.52 1.3 432.77 0.55 431.86 0.55 L 2.21 0.55 C 1.3 0.55 0.55 1.3 0.55 2.21 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 7.47 23.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.29em;--ltx-fo-height:0.56em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.36em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 7.69)" width="419.13"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.29em;">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#E11D48;">Failure mode:</span><span id="A8.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> Dropped negation.
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A8.F21.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 21</span>: </span><span id="A8.F21.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">MTNT EN<math id="A8.F21.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>FR: semantic failure from dropped negation.<span id="A8.F21.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Not all errors are formatting failures: this example shows that negation can be overlooked by the fine-tuned models. EBFT preserves the negative meaning of the source sentence, whereas RLVR drops the negation and changes “no more available rooms” into “more rooms.” The base model again exhibits multilingual repetition after an initially plausible translation, and SFT produces a weaker paraphrase that underspecifies the original statement.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
